 been pretty small because my brother-in-law used to throw me on his shoulder if I went to sleep in the theatre, and bring me home like that. He took me up there to see her, what she was doing. She had her legs crossed, with a cigarette in her mouth, playing and writing music for the next act. When the next act came on ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12419$98E25867-C6F5-40E0-8184-905BAB9A83D7", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "41ca4890358c663b1c48418ea336f6d32a2c5807", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/7f2d6063335b48edf115ddc57d56bb92/231.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12419$BFF2CD55-91FF-47BA-9D27-4E65FFBC8C81", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f537db9dcf4e34ac0e17370ac8110b1c9321232b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 304, "id": "Q304"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12419$852F11B0-D37C-4C84-9A8E-3E044C09DD0E", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "33eabf49c5b67bcf22e11ff387a4035cb991d4a8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 50, "id": "Q50"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12419$13189B7B-4C02-48C5-92BD-D53B4441DD40", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f93c2efd3e02c591e7628477a4258ab6cc4762eb", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1156, "id": "Q1156"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12419$8B751223-1490-442F-AD66-9B600B600386", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "e1689792b7d4d5d7c5e1807ce858e4cb68703f04", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "it